    <h1>🔒 MEENGLE - PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: January 2024 | Jurisdiction: South Africa (POPIA Compliant)</p>

    <div class="popia-note">
      <strong>🇿🇦 POPIA COMPLIANCE:</strong> This Privacy Policy complies with the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA), South Africa's data protection law. MEENGLE is committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with POPIA principles.
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>1. INTRODUCTION</h2>
      <p>At MEENGLE (PTY) LTD, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our website, mobile application, and related services in South Africa.</p>
      <p><strong>Please read this policy carefully.</strong> If you do not agree with our practices, please do not use MEENGLE.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT</h2>
      <h3>A. Information You Provide Directly</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account Registration:</strong> Name, email, phone number, date of birth, location, gender, sexual orientation</li>
        <li><strong>Profile Information:</strong> Bio, interests, photos, relationship goals, education, occupation</li>
        <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Credit card details (processed via Stripe; we do NOT store full card numbers)</li>
        <li><strong>Messages & Communications:</strong> All messages between users</li>
        <li><strong>Support Requests:</strong> Emails, complaints, and customer service interactions</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>B. Information Collected Automatically</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> IP address, device type, operating system, browser type</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, features used, interactions, time spent, clicks</li>
        <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> Approximate location (if you grant permission) for matching purposes</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies & Tracking:</strong> Session cookies, preference cookies, analytics tracking</li>
        <li><strong>Log Data:</strong> Server logs including timestamps, access times, referring sources</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>C. Information from Third Parties</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Social media platforms (if you use social login)</li>
        <li>Payment processors (Stripe for transaction verification)</li>
        <li>Law enforcement (if legally required under South African law)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>3. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION (POPIA LAWFUL BASIS)</h2>
      <p>Under POPIA, we process personal information based on:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> You have consented to the processing</li>
        <li><strong>Contract:</strong> Processing is necessary to perform our service agreement with you</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Obligation:</strong> Processing is required by South African law</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate Interest:</strong> Processing is necessary for legitimate purposes (safety, fraud prevention, service improvement)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We use collected information for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Service Delivery: Creating and maintaining your account, matching you with potential partners</li>
        <li>Communication: Sending updates, notifications, security alerts, and responses to inquiries</li>
        <li>Personalization: Tailoring the app to your preferences and interests</li>
        <li>Analytics: Understanding how users interact with MEENGLE to improve the service</li>
        <li>Safety & Security: Detecting fraud, abuse, spam, and unauthorized access</li>
        <li>Legal Compliance: Complying with South African laws and regulations</li>
        <li>Marketing: Sending optional promotional communications (you can opt-out anytime)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>4. WHO WE SHARE YOUR INFORMATION WITH</h2>
      <h3>A. Information We DO Share</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>With Other Users:</strong> Your profile information (name, photos, bio, interests) is visible to other MEENGLE users for matching purposes</li>
        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Third parties that help us operate (Stripe for payments, SendGrid for emails, AWS for hosting) under data processing agreements</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> If required by law, court order, or government request</li>
        <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> If MEENGLE is acquired or merges, your data may be transferred (with notice to you)</li>
        <li><strong>With Your Consent:</strong> If you explicitly authorize sharing with specific parties</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>B. Information We DO NOT Share</h3>
      <div class="highlight">
        <strong>✓ We DO NOT sell your personal information to advertisers or data brokers in violation of POPIA</strong>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not share your private messages with anyone</li>
        <li>We do not share your email with other users</li>
        <li>We do not share your phone number with other users</li>
        <li>We do not share your payment information with other users</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>5. DATA RETENTION (POPIA REQUIREMENT)</h2>
      <p>In accordance with POPIA's retention principle, we retain information only as long as necessary:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Active Accounts:</strong> All information retained while your account is active</li>
        <li><strong>Deleted Accounts:</strong> Most data deleted within 30 days; some legal/fraud data retained for up to 3 years as required by law</li>
        <li><strong>Messages:</strong> Deleted when both users delete a conversation (or within 90 days of account deletion)</li>
        <li><strong>Payment Records:</strong> Retained for 3 years for tax compliance under South African CIPC requirements</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>6. YOUR POPIA RIGHTS</h2>
      <p>Under the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013, you have the following rights:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to Know:</strong> You have the right to confirm whether MEENGLE holds your personal information</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> Request a copy of your personal data in a comprehensible form</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Correction:</strong> Update inaccurate, incomplete, or outdated information</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your account and data (subject to legal obligations)</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Object:</strong> Object to processing of your personal information</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Restrict Processing:</strong> Limit how we use your data</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Lodge a Complaint:</strong> Complain to the Information Regulator (SA) if you believe your rights are violated</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <strong>privacy@meengle.co.za</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>7. DATA SECURITY & TECHNICAL SAFEGUARDS</h2>
      <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data in accordance with POPIA:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> All data in transit uses SSL/TLS encryption (https)</li>
        <li><strong>Password Protection:</strong> Passwords are hashed with bcryptjs</li>
        <li><strong>Access Controls:</strong> Only authorized employees can access user data</li>
        <li><strong>Firewalls & Monitoring:</strong> 24/7 security monitoring and intrusion detection</li>
        <li><strong>Regular Audits:</strong> Regular security assessments and penetration testing</li>
        <li><strong>Incident Response:</strong> We have procedures to notify you of data breaches within 31 days as required by POPIA</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>However,</strong> no security system is 100% impenetrable. We cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>8. COOKIES & TRACKING (ECTA COMPLIANCE)</h2>
      <p>In accordance with the Electronic Communications and Transactions Act, 2002 (ECTA), MEENGLE uses cookies for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Maintaining your session, security</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> Understanding user behavior (Google Analytics)</li>
        <li><strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Remembering your settings</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect some features. We obtain your consent before setting non-essential cookies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>9. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY</h2>
      <p>MEENGLE is not intended for users under 18 years old. We do not knowingly collect information from minors. If we discover a child has created an account, we will delete it immediately and notify their parents/guardians if possible.</p>
    </div>

